%% MY-SKILLS · sole official runtime map (00)
%% When updating flow/QC/entry, edit only this file. Sub-flows = branches here; no second master map.
%% Gate detail SSOT: gates.md; external-pack lifecycle: 00
%% Diagram node naming: Gate · NN ↔ gates.md G-NN; the merged 02 stats gate is `Gate · STATS` = `G-STATS`. G0 / G-PHI / G-FACT / G-LIT / G-CODE same names.
%% Mid-entry still allowed (existing stats→05, existing manuscript→06; do not re-run from 02).
%% Any manuscript writing or review must pass 03 citation-verify before done / Gate·05 / Gate·06.
%% 05 and 06 must not self-certify literature. Lee: statement consistency → data consistency; lit accuracy joint with Victor.
%% Ownership: see 00_orchestrator/references/ownership-contract.md
%% Seats: 02 Loopnow · 03 Victor · 05+07 Aitee · 06 Lee · 00 Aitor(QC) · Bai=ethics forms+portal submit (off 00 main loop)
%% Response → 07/Aitee. Review/re-review → 06/Lee. Ethics forms+portal submit → Bai.
%% Layering: base fine-ID first-pass loops -> 00 QC gate -> advanced/top re-loops.
%% inspired by ARS pipeline topology (Integrity pre-06 + review↔revise + R&R; short original text only).
%% QC standards (pass/fail only) live under 05_manuscript/qc/ and 06_review/qc/; 00 loads at gates — not capability bodies.
%% Capability bodies live under NN_slug/base/. Advanced layers keep route/handoff/authority only.
%% 03 post-QC may trigger verify-refs integrity stage (bodies under 03_research/base/).
%% 05 post-QC: advanced De-AI (report-only lint, then de-AI pass; absorbed retired humanize) alongside Aitor-format/voice.
%% 06 post-QC: re-review only. 07 owns response (final authority).
%% 02/03 exits are artifact or evidence checks, not a fact-lineage node.
%% Rework budget is per same defect (defects[].rounds ≤ 3), not global qc.rounds.

flowchart TD
    Start([Task enter]) --> Detect[00 · Detect materials / intent / entry / exit]

    %% Plan card / grilling / flowchart approval (multi-node, new capability, or fine ids needed)
    Detect --> MultiQ{Multi-node / new capability / fine ids needed?}
    MultiQ -->|yes| GrillPlan[grilling · Plan card]
    GrillPlan --> FlowAppr[Flowchart approval · highlight this path on full map]
    %% Results page and reviewer letter both present and user did not name entry: ask first; do not auto-pick by nearest artifact.
    FlowAppr -->|explicit approve| Conflict{Results page + reviewer letter both present<br/>and entry not named?}
    MultiQ -->|no · single-node advanced| Conflict
    Conflict -->|yes| AskEntry[Ask which station to enter]
    AskEntry --> Entry{Run entry}
    Conflict -->|no| Entry
    Entry -->|Full research pipeline| Need02[Enter 02 · Loopnow]
    Entry -->|Data-processing results exist| NeedStats[Enter 02 · stats/figures · Loopnow]
    Entry -->|Stats/figures exist · mid-entry OK| Need05[Enter 05 · Aitee]
    Entry -->|Review/pre-review → 06 Lee| Need06[Enter 06 · Lee review]
    Entry -->|R&R main loop → 06 Lee| R06[06 R&R control]
    Entry -->|Reply/response → 07 Aitee| Need07[Enter 07 · Aitee reply]
    Entry -->|Standalone lit task| Need03[Enter 03 · Victor]
    Entry -->|Deep code QC| NeedCode[Enter 02 code QC]
    Entry -->|Other clear single domain| NeedS[Enter target Skill]
    Entry -->|Single-node advanced · no fine id dependency| Advanced[e.g. polish one sentence · no fine id ask]

    %% R&R: triage then return to node; re-run only forward affected chain
    R06 --> Decide{06 locate problem source}
    Decide -->|Data| Need02
    Decide -->|Stats / figures| NeedStats
    Decide -->|Lit evidence| Need03
    Decide -->|Writing| Need05
    Decide -->|Review integration| Need06
    Decide -->|Reply / response| Need07

    %% Independent run needs one fine-id pick. Reuse lock if covered; else enter 00.
    Need02 & Need03 & NeedStats & Need05 & Need06 & Need07 & NeedS & NeedCode --> FineIdQ{session_picked_fine_ids<br/>covers this task fine IDs?}
    FineIdQ -->|yes · reuse session lock| GA0
    FineIdQ -->|no| SFineId[00 · Session fine-id pick / Lifecycle]
    SFineId --> GA0{{G0}}
    GA0 -->|PASS| Ready[Fine ids ready]
    GA0 -->|FAIL| Locate
    Advanced --> Single

    %% Main production pattern: base fine-ID first-pass -> 00 QC -> advanced/top re-loop
    Ready --> LayerBase[base · fine-ID first-pass loops]
    LayerBase --> LayerQC{{00 QC gate}}
    LayerQC -->|PASS| LayerTop[advanced/top re-loops<br/>03/05/06/07 as needed]
    LayerTop --> Dispatch{Target node}
    LayerQC -->|FAIL| Locate
    Dispatch -->|02| P02[02 data processing · Loopnow]
    Dispatch -->|03| P03[03 medical research · Victor]
    Dispatch -->|02 stats| PStats[02 stats/figures · Loopnow]
    Dispatch -->|05| P05[05 manuscript writing · Aitee]
    Dispatch -->|06| I25
    I25[Integrity · pre-06<br/>G-FACT+G-CIT + RG subset + AI-fail lite] --> P06[06 review/pre-review · Lee]
    Dispatch -->|07| P07[07 reply to reviewers · Aitee]
    Dispatch -->|Deep code QC| PCode[02 · code QC]
    Dispatch -->|Single domain| Single[Target Skill]

    subgraph CHAIN[Main production chain · advance only on PASS · mid-entry OK · writing/review must pass 03 citation-verify]
        P02 --> N2{{N2 · G-PHI<br/>before table/clinical extract}}
        N2 -->|PASS| Exit02{{02 exit · G0 + G-PHI (when applicable) + artifact exists}}
        Exit02 -->|PASS · not at destination| PStats
        PStats --> GFStats{{G-FACT · after 02 HTML}}
        GFStats -->|PASS| GAStats{{Gate · STATS}}
        GAStats -->|PASS · not at destination| N3{N3 WRITE<br/>Stop at HTML or enter sci-manuscript?}
        N3 -->|Enter writing| P05
        N3 -->|Stop at HTML| Out
        P05 --> GF05{{G-FACT · after 05 house.docx}}
        GF05 -->|PASS| Lit05[03 Victor · citation-verify<br/>G-CIT-1 draft evidence verify<br/>claim→ref table + spot-check strong claims vs full text]
        Lit05 -->|PASS| StyleLint{{G-05 · style-lint sub-check}}
        StyleLint -->|PASS| GA05{{Gate · 05}}
        GA05 -->|PASS · not at destination| N4{N4 PREVIEW<br/>Enter 06 or stop?}
        N4 -->|Enter 06| I25
        N4 -->|Stop| Out
        P06 --> Lee06[Lee · statement → data consistency<br/>comments only · no default auto-edit]
        P06 --> Lit06[03 Victor · citation-verify<br/>G-CIT-2 post-revision / inside 06<br/>mandatory · G-CIT-1 does not waive G-CIT-2<br/>lit accuracy joint with Lee]
        Lee06 --> Join06[06 complete · consistency + lit verify]
        Lit06 -->|PASS| GF06{{G-FACT · only when 06 cites numbers}}
        GF06 -->|PASS| Join06
        Join06 --> GA06{{Gate · 06}}
        GA06 -->|PASS · reply needed| P07
        GA06 -->|findings · revise needed| Rev{Revise needed?}
        Rev -->|Body TC · Aitee| Need05
        Rev -->|Reply · Aitee| Need07
        Rev -->|no · complete| I45
        Need05 -.->|after 06 findings revise · R&R| P06r
        P06r[06 re-review · R&amp;R traceability<br/>verification only · frozen Round-1] --> I45[Integrity · post-re-review lite<br/>G-FACT spot + AI-fail lite]
        I45 --> RRBud{re-review loops ≤2?}
        RRBud -->|yes · still needs revise| Rev
        RRBud -->|Complete| Out
        RRBud -->|no · over budget| Escalate
    end

    %% 07 conditional G-LIT: no new cites → GA07; cites appear → Lit07 (G-LIT) → GA07. No new Gate id.
    P07 -->|no new cites| GA07{{Gate · 07 · response / Aitee}}
    P07 -->|cites appear| Lit07{{Lit07 · G-LIT when cites}}
    Lit07 -->|PASS| GA07
    GA07 -->|PASS| Out

    P03 --> Exit03{{03 exit · G0 + G-LIT + evidence/citation artifacts}}
    Exit03 -.->|PASS · evidence supply at draft time · does not replace citation-verify| P05
    Exit03 -.->|PASS · evidence supply at draft time · does not replace citation-verify| I25
    PCode --> GCODE{{G-CODE}}
    GCODE -->|PASS| Out
    Single --> GAS{{Gate · target Skill}}

    %% At destination with last gate PASS, or user says end → stage: done; do not open next station.
    %% Before 05 delivery done / Gate·05: Lit05 must PASS (claim→ref table + strong-claim spot-check).
    %% 06 review: Lit06 is mandatory; Lee still does statement then data consistency. Prior 05 verify does not waive 06.
    %% 07 response: Lit07 / G-LIT only when the letter or revised ms cites literature; otherwise P07 → GA07 directly.
    %% Manuscript Track Changes are landed by Aitee.Ownership: see 00_orchestrator/references/ownership-contract.md
    %% Pause, or stop after results page / before pre-review: leave stage at current station; do not write done.
    %% Later stations in the same approved run report one line; N2, results-page G-FACT, N4, G-06 still stop.
    Exit02 & GAStats & GA05 & GA06 & GA07 & Exit03 & GAS & GCODE -->|PASS · at destination| Out([Final output<br/>stage: done])

    %% QC loop: return to failed node and reuse session lock. Re-enter 00 only on missing dependency / stale provenance / new capability.
    Exit02 & N2 & GFStats & GAStats & GF05 & StyleLint & GA05 & GF06 & GA06 & GA07 & Exit03 & GAS & GCODE -->|FAIL| Locate[Locate minimal responsible node]
    I25 & I45 -->|FAIL · HARD integrity| Locate
    Lit05 & Lit06 & Lit07 -->|FAIL| Locate
    Locate --> Impact{Does upstream error<br/>invalidate downstream results?}
    Impact -->|no| Local[Local rework · target node only]
    Impact -->|yes| Rollback[Roll back to earliest affected node]
    Local --> Budget{Same defect defects[].rounds ≤ 3?}
    Rollback --> Budget
    Budget -->|yes| Resume[Re-enter failed node · reuse session fine-id lock]
    Resume --> RePick{Missing dependency, stale provenance, or new capability needed?}
    RePick -->|no| BackNode[Return to failed node]
    BackNode --> Dispatch
    RePick -->|yes| SFineId
    Budget -->|no| Escalate[Stop auto-loop · unresolved<br/>stage does not advance]
    Escalate --> Wait([Wait for user decision])
    Wait -.->|Authorized continue · reset that defect rounds| Locate
